    the field; destroy it. This card gains 500 ATK for each face-up \"Deskbot\" monster
    in your Extra Deck. If this card in the Pendulum Zone is destroyed: You can target
    1 \"Deskbot\" monster in your Graveyard; Special Summon it. You can only use
    this effect of \"Deskbot 005\" once per turn."
